:402 now asserts both branches: with the Worker stopped the `run_abort` revocation is still
present and the retry stays queued with the model never called; once the Worker sweeps the abort
and deletes the row, the retry takes the session, leaves queued, and its reply reaches the
transcript. :546 (Routine failure) and :785 (outbox restart) are untouched and still pass.


